          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I started drawing at 29, on a train, in the back of a work notebook. Nobody had told me it was a skill you could practise like any other.</p><p>Since then I have filled more than [number] sketchbooks, taught [number] people in workshops and written a book about the ten minutes before breakfast that changed how I see.</p><p>This site is where I keep everything I make. Most of it is free.</p>"
